space all you see is the topmost item.  If it happens to be the tip of an 
iceberg of 20 wands (say), and you have autopickup on for wands (if it 
existed) then you will be overburdened before you know it and will soon be 
monster-fodder.  Otherwise I think this might be a good idea.

